  "description": "Authority-based coordination over DisposableHost epochs.\n\t\t\tProvides IAuthorityEpochProvider abstractions for deterministic\n\t\t\townership, ordered participation, and controlled FinalDispose behavior\n\t\t\tacross concurrent consumers.",
